{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 28, "ref": "2-samuel 13:28", "book": "2-samuel", "lang": "pcm", "chapter": 13, "translation": "Avshalom bin command ⟨את⟩ im boys, sey: 'Look ⟨now⟩, when ⟨את⟩ Amnon im heart don good wit wine, and I talk to una, Strike ⟨את⟩ Amnon, and una kill ⟨am⟩. ⟨את⟩ No fear! No be so sey na me command ⟨una⟩? Make una strong, and make una be sons of power!'", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויצו", "gloss": "bin command"}, {"surface": "אבשלום", "gloss": "Avshalom"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "im boys"}, {"surface": "נעריו", "gloss": "im boys"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "sey"}, {"surface": "ראו", "gloss": "Look"}, {"surface": "נא", "gloss": "⟨now⟩"}, {"surface": "כטוב", "gloss": "when ⟨don good⟩"}, {"surface": "לב", "gloss": "im heart"}, {"surface": "אמנון", "gloss": "Amnon"}, {"surface": "ביין", "gloss": "wit wine"}, {"surface": "ואמרתי", "gloss": "and I talk"}, {"surface": "אליכם", "gloss": "to una"}, {"surface": "הכו", "gloss": "Strike"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "Amnon"}, {"surface": "אמנון", "gloss": "Amnon"}, {"surface": "והמתם", "gloss": "and una kill"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "am"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "No"}, {"surface": "תיראו", "gloss": "fear"}, {"surface": "הלוא", "gloss": "No be so"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "sey"}, {"surface": "אנכי", "gloss": "na me"}, {"surface": "צויתי", "gloss": "command"}, {"surface": "אתכם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "una"}, {"surface": "חזקו", "gloss": "Make una strong"}, {"surface": "והיו", "gloss": "and make una be"}, {"surface": "לבני", "gloss": "sons of"}, {"surface": "חיל", "gloss": "power"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-11T10:51:09.768027348Z", "model": "glm-5.2"}